{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["<b>Who smote Midian in the field of Moab.</b> Midian came against Moab to battle, and the king of Edom went to aid Moab. From this we learn that Midian and Moab were at strife with each other, but in the days of Balaam they made peace to ally against Israel."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:02:17.991683629Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}